  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Non-Budget Support Financial Aid to the Government of Rwanda in support of social protection programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Exiting Poverty in Rwanda (EPR) programme supports Rwanda&#x2019;s social protection system to effectively and sustainably meet the needs of the poorest and most vulnerable people, to enable them to be more resilient to shocks (e.g., climatic) and to escape poverty. This project is a Non-Budget Support Financial Aid (NBSFA) to Local Administrative Entities Development Agency (LODA) for the Exiting Poverty in Rwanda (EPR) Programme</narrative>
  </description>
